#. Title of the settings panel (this game: rules, players, AI level).
#: scenes/greybox/hud.gd:188
msgid "Game"
msgstr "Partita"

#: scenes/greybox/hud.gd:191 scenes/greybox/hud.gd:392
msgid "Hide"
